# Image digests published by CI for a specific commit. Written by the
# capacity-images job; consumed by the bootstrap and the seed helper.
#
# Deliberately empty here: with no digests the helpers build from the pinned
# checkout, which is the mode CI exercises. A measurement run pins the digests
# before launch so the guest pulls exactly what CI built and compiles nothing.
# Never `latest`: a mutable tag is how an earlier attempt ran code from a
# different revision than the one that was tested.
FIXTURE_API_DIGEST=""
FIXTURE_MIGRATE_DIGEST=""
FIXTURE_WEB_DIGEST=""
